      "source": "urn:rulespec:document-understanding:document:c488e692660a4799f378685cde066db70ac2b7c695ea4b7ae8cda442ba4fce09",
      "text": "For finance reporting, an annual report (AR) means the signed yearly account of spending. In the following finance rules, AR always means annual report.\n\n",
